# snuf demo recording
Output docs/screenshot.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 720
Set Height 520
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 24
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.85

Hide
  Type "cd /Users/artm/Code/snuf"
  Enter
  Sleep 200ms
  Type "alias npx\ snuf=snuf"
  Enter
  Sleep 200ms
Show

Sleep 1s
Type "npx snuf"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
Sleep 4s
